<!--
  Apple Configuration Profile for Lock Screen Footnote
  Payload Type: com.apple.shareddeviceconfiguration
  Note on Compatibility & Supervision:
  - This payload conforms to Apple's official Device Management schema.
  - On standard iOS devices, installing this profile displays the footnote above the Home Bar.
  - In certain strict corporate/enterprise policies or iOS sub-builds, some SharedDeviceConfiguration
    keys may require Supervision (Apple Configurator / MDM enrollment).
  - Removal: Settings -> General -> VPN & Device Management -> Select profile -> Remove.
-->
